    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-ψηφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>voting with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ τοῖς ἐχθίστοις ὁμόψηφοι γένησθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. κατά τινων τοῖς τριάκοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					13.94
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having an equal right to vote with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι στρατηγοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.109
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ τῶν σφετέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.149
				</span></i>
			.</div>
